        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A granny strip table runner is 40 classic granny squares, 4 wide by 10 long: joined into a 36 × 90 cm table runner. Each square is worked from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "magic ring",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " through three rounds of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "granny clusters",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "granny-cluster"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "; the squares are joined with a slip-stitch seam. Works in one colour for a clean, modern look or in random leftover colours for a traditional patchwork effect."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
